# Only needed to refresh the News Channel's headlines locally:
#
#   npm run fetch:news
#
# The deployed site does NOT read this. GitHub Actions holds the key as a repo
# secret and commits the result to public/news/feed.json, so the key is never
# compiled into the client bundle and visitors never spend from the allowance.
#
# Note there is no VITE_ prefix — that prefix is exactly what used to publish
# the key to every visitor's browser. Do not add one back.
#
# Free key at https://gnews.io (free tier ~100 requests/day; one refresh of all
# seven sections costs 12).

GNEWS_KEY=
